      "en": "“I removed his shoulder from the burden. His hands were freed from the basket.",
      "ko": "이르시되 내가 그 어깨에서 짐을 벗기고 그 손에서 광주리를 놓게 하였도다",
      "source_text_hash": "7337910d52a8f6b93e6f19f96e333eef01f4f6e7fd52ff6345aa8f39401bdc88",
      "translation_text_hash": "8fc9ac650280f63b9d97a9ec7606ce40613da4694bf8a41ba62a20985550e21a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
