      "en": "“Hear, my people, and I will testify to you, Israel, if you would listen to me!",
      "ko": "내 백성이여 들으라 내가 네게 증거하리라 이스라엘이여 내게 듣기를 원하노라",
      "source_text_hash": "ffc34d7d0d3a91dc71336762780c9e3ef75d726e6a216a83c57111fdb50317f1",
      "translation_text_hash": "20a41c6a9e43da0170c7d193001f7085d932d914943273a504922b42b2d0771a",
