      "en": "But my people didn’t listen to my voice. Israel desired none of me.",
      "ko": "내 백성이 내 소리를 듣지 아니하며 이스라엘이 나를 원치 아니하였도다",
      "source_text_hash": "ba3669d777ec5c92e6b92508cb53d49453dadb060aae6a30fe4d1d60471890b3",
      "translation_text_hash": "33a89b6e1b808214486efa2fb4af9a2162650afa7a9526b17119e6170d6be216",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
